@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
hide empty methods
title 001 Guided Notes - Main Questions, Subitems and Merged Ranges
class SourceDocument {
 ownerTeacherIdentity
 spreadsheetIdentity
 worksheetIdentity
 displayName
}
class ImportedCatalog {
 importIdentity
 importVersion
 questionCount
 answerItemCount
 confirmed
}
class ImportPreview {
 previewIdentity
 sourceIdentity
 fingerprints
 state: ready / confirmed / invalidated
 confirmedImportIdentity [optional]
 confirmedVersion [optional]
}
class LectureDisplayName {
 nameMode: source / custom
 customTitle [optional]
}
class MainQuestion {
 candidateOrPublishedIdentity
 questionIdentity = unitIdentity
 displayNumber
 kind: single or question-set
 sourceNumberRange
}
class ImportBundle {
 candidateCatalog
 recognizedSource
 spreadsheetIdentity
}
class Fingerprints {
 semanticHash
 structureHash
 valueHash
}
class AnswerItem {
 itemIdentity
 subitemLabel [optional]
 memberOrder
}
class Blank {
 blankIdentity
}
class SourceBinding {
 answerRange
 topLeftAnchor
 labelRange [optional]
 observedOriginalContent
}
class ActivityReference {
 activityIdentity
 importIdentity
 importVersion
 ended
}
class ResultSnapshot {
 resultVersion
 activityIdentity
 importIdentity
 importVersion
}
class UnitResult {
 questionIdentity
 winnerGroupIdentity [optional]
 explicitNoWinner
}
class ItemAnswer {
 itemIdentity
 blankIdentity
 answerText
}
class ExportPreview {
 previewIdentity
 resultVersion
 sourceObservations
 valid
 teacherConfirmed
}
class PreviewItem {
 targetRange
 originalText
 proposedText
 difference
}
class WriteOperation {
 operationIdentity
 previewIdentity
 idempotencyKey
 teacherIdentity
 resultVersion
 state
}
class SourceLease {
 spreadsheetIdentity
 worksheetIdentity
 ownerToken
 operationIdentity
 expiresAt
}
class WriteReport {
 operationIdentity
 resultVersion
 overallOutcome
}
class WriteItem {
 questionIdentity
 itemIdentity
 blankIdentity
 outcome
 locatedError
}
SourceDocument "1" -- "0..*" ImportedCatalog
SourceDocument "1" -- "0..*" ImportPreview
ImportPreview --> ImportBundle : recognized candidate
ImportPreview --> ImportedCatalog : atomic publish once
ImportPreview "1" *-- "1" LectureDisplayName : saved choice
ImportedCatalog "1" *-- "1" LectureDisplayName : per-version display metadata
LectureDisplayName --> SourceDocument : source mode uses worksheet title
ImportBundle --> ImportedCatalog : candidate IDs; repository publishes later
ImportBundle --> Fingerprints : current observations
ExportPreview --> Fingerprints : freshness guard
ImportedCatalog "1" *-- "1..*" MainQuestion
MainQuestion "1" *-- "1..*" AnswerItem
AnswerItem "1" *-- "1" Blank
Blank "1" -- "1" SourceBinding
ActivityReference "0..*" --> "1" ImportedCatalog
ResultSnapshot "0..*" --> "1" ActivityReference
ResultSnapshot "1" *-- "1..*" UnitResult
UnitResult --> MainQuestion : same version and exact item membership
UnitResult "1" *-- "0..*" ItemAnswer
ItemAnswer --> AnswerItem : same main question
ExportPreview --> ImportedCatalog
ExportPreview --> ResultSnapshot
ExportPreview "1" *-- "0..*" PreviewItem
WriteOperation --> ExportPreview
SourceLease --> WriteOperation : one active writer per source
WriteReport --> WriteOperation
WriteReport --> ExportPreview
WriteReport "1" *-- "0..*" WriteItem
note right of MainQuestion
One main number = one submission unit.
Single: one item. Set: all subitems.
One winner per main question.
end note
note right of SourceBinding
Use headers and merged ranges.
Preserve (1), (2) labels and formatting.
Write only the answer range top-left anchor.
end note
note left of ImportBundle
Offline core builds candidates, never publishes.
Current source is reidentified before recovery.
Authorization, persistence and leases stay external.
end note
note left of LectureDisplayName
Teacher display only; CatalogDTO is unchanged.
Source sheetId and answer bindings never depend on names.
end note
note right of WriteItem
Verified / failed / not processed / unknown / skipped.
Retry reads first; confirm conflicts.
end note
@enduml
